      "title": "Kalpataru Projects International Limited (NSEI:KPIL) has entered into share sale, exit, and release agreement to acquire remaining 35% stake in Kalpataru IBN Omairah Company Limited from BIN Omairah Contracting Company Limited for SAR 10 million.",
      "body": "Kalpataru Projects International Limited (NSEI:KPIL) has entered into share sale, exit, and release agreement to acquire remaining 35% stake in Kalpataru IBN Omairah Company Limited from BIN Omairah Contracting Company Limited for SAR 10 million on February 23, 2026. The consideration will be paid by cash through banking channels. As part of the acquisition, Kalpataru Projects International Limited will acquire 175 equity shares representing 35% equity stake of Kalpataru IBN Omairah Company Limited. Upon completion, Kalpataru IBN Omairah Company Limited will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Kalpataru Projects International Limited. The acquisition will further strengthen the Company’s presence in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia market.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Kalpataru IBN Om",
      "keyDevTypeId": "80",
